        {
          "path": "_m/r/c/j/g/lake-waikaremoana-wp/onepoto-redoubt-on-the-shore-o.jpg",
          "filename": "Onepoto Redoubt on the shore of Lake Waikaremoana, 1874 (27526385843).jpg",
          "caption": "The Onepoto redoubt, Te Upoko-o-Te Ao, was built of stone with earth sods (as shown on the lower left of the image). Constructed in 1871 as part of the campaign against Te Kooti, the redoubt was manned by Armed Constabulary troops until 1877. It guarded the 'frontier' into Te Urewera from the East Coast, and a government boat also patrolled the lake. It was scaled back to a police base from 1878.\nThe photograph itself comes from a fragile album of New Zealand War memorials, graves and sites. It was created by the War Graves Branch of the Department of Internal Affairs, and includes images from across the country.\nArchives Reference: IA76 Box 5/ 29\narchway.archives.govt.nz/ViewFullItem.do?code=22252525\nMaterial from Archives New Zealand\n\nCaption information from Encircled Lands by Judith Binney",
          "alt": "The Onepoto redoubt, Te Upoko-o-Te Ao, was built of stone with earth sods (as shown on the lower left of the image). Constructed in 1871 as part of the campaign against Te Kooti, the redoubt was manned by Armed Constabulary troops until 1877. It guarded the 'frontier' into Te Urewera from the East Coast, and a government boat also patrolled the lake. It was scaled back to a police base from 1878.\nThe photograph itself comes from a fragile album of New Zealand War memorials, graves and sites. It was created by the War Graves Branch of the Department of Internal Affairs, and includes images from across the country.\nArchives Reference: IA76 Box 5/ 29\narchway.archives.govt.nz/ViewFullItem.do?code=22252525\nMaterial from Archives New Zealand\n\nCaption information from Encircled Lands by Judith Binney",
          "width": 1694,
          "height": 1306,
          "mimeType": "image/jpeg",
          "license": "CC BY-SA 2.0",
          "artist": "Archives New Zealand from New Zealand",
          "sourceUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Onepoto_Redoubt_on_the_shore_of_Lake_Waikaremoana,_1874_(27526385843).jpg",
